#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:7
#: 22f92da8a0d04a569038f04991ab5d8f 49b7afc5c98b4146afc2cf81c15af9d3
#: cfff7ba3429549858360b998c7f3289c dcce6dd3f198422da326163f7096ef54
#: edc4943524144fd6a2d10008627be7a9
msgid ""
"ArduSimple provides a number of UBlox F9P based GNSS receivers that support "
"RTK and GPS-for-Yaw. Using RTK allows ArduPilot with centimeter level "
"accuracy which is much more accurate than a normal GPS."
msgstr ""
"ArduSimple 提供多种基于 UBlox F9P 的 GNSS 接收机，支持 RTK 和 GPS 偏航。使用 RTK 允许 ArduPilot "
"实现厘米级精度，远比普通 GPS 准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:9
