#: f23c87a7b96a484f82f295df9708a8e6
msgid ""
"The simpleRTK2B system has two receiver modules which plug together and the "
"simpleRTK3b is a single integrated unit."
msgstr "simpleRTK2B 系统有两个插合在一起的接收机模块，simpleRTK3b 是单一集成单元。"

