"For normal GPS only operation, ArduPilot's GPS parameter defaults will work "
"for any serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5."
msgstr ""
"对于普通 GPS 操作，ArduPilot 的 GPS 参数默认值适用于任何配置了 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5 的串口。"

